37 to 1944, before being transferred to Luzon in the Philippines in order to defend against the US advance in the Pacific. The division was annihilated in the Battle of Luzon in 1945 where it fought under the command of Japanese Fourteenth Area Army.","LocalizedString":"The 63rd Infantry Regiment (Matsue) was a unit of the 10th Division (codenamed Iron Division) of the Imperial Japanese Army. The division fought in the Russo-Japanese War (1904-1905), the Second Sino-Japanese war (1937-1945) and finally in the Pacific War (1941-1945). The division saw extensive combat in China from 1937 to 1944, before being transferred to Luzon in the Philippines in order to defend against the US advance in the Pacific. The division was annihilated in the Battle of Luzon in 1945 where it fought under the command of Japanese Fourteenth Area Army."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","waitWithOnOtherCardPlayedUntilHandTargetSelected":true,"selectHandCardNotifyText":{"Namespace":"","Key":"7116EB39453F3B12A546508A5724F19D","SourceString":"Choose a card in hand to discard","LocalizedString":"Choose a card in hand to discard"},"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Legions","isReserved":true,"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Guard","EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment"],"hasDeployment":true,"hasGuard":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion_Medium'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/Explosion_Medium.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Japan/CandidateArtwork/jap_inf_21.jap_inf_21","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Volmi Games","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/MATSUE_REGIMENT.MATSUE_REGIMENT","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":384.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_matsue_regiment_photo","SourceString":"Japanese troops landing on the Island of Luzon, 1941.","LocalizedString":"Japanese troops landing on the Island of Luzon, 1941."},"blowUpExplosionNi